<title>USA: Kellwood reports on stock buyback status.</title>
<headline>Kellwood reports on stock buyback status.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellwood Co said Tuesday that as of November 22 it had repurchased about 324,300 of its shares under an authorization to buy back up to 10 percent of the approximately 21 million outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Kellwood is an manufacturer and marketer of apparel.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
